<Layout title="About us - Makkeroni" lang="en">
  <h1>Our History: From Naples to Barcelona</h1>
  <p>The story of our delicatessen began in the spring of 2016, in the Poblenou neighborhood of Barcelona. We are a couple from Naples, a city that, while known for its rich culinary tradition, is also a vibrant city with a life full of simple, everyday moments, where food plays an important role.</p>
  <p>The idea of opening an Italian shop in Barcelona arose from the desire to share with others what we love so much: authentic flavors, quality ingredients, and traditional recipes that, although simple, have a unique power to make any meal a special moment.</p>
  <p>We didn't want to simply sell products; we wanted to be a guide, a place to offer honest advice and share our passion for Italian ingredients. We knew that, as a small shop, personal service and honesty would be our greatest strength.</p>
  <p>What matters most to us is friendly service, courtesy, and honesty. Our job isn't just to sell, but to guide our customers so they find what they're really looking for, with the confidence that we're offering them the highest quality products.</p>
  <p>What began as a small Italian products store has grown thanks to the trust of our customers, who have valued not only the quality of our products but also the honesty with which we advise them.</p>
  <p>Today, our store remains a reflection of who we are: a place of trust, where every product has a story to tell and every piece of advice is given from the heart.</p>
  <p>Our mission remains the same: to share the best of Italy, without pretension or artifice, with the same passion with which we began this project.</p>
  <p><strong>Thank you for making us a part of your lives. See you soon in our store!</strong></p>
</Layout>
